  unitName: Burst Queen
  unitId: 750004
  unitNumber: 9998
  description: Rarely seen till the arrival of a stranger from Paskua, Burst Mothers
    are a highly protective variety of magical amphibian found in Grand Gaia. They
    are quite kind to those who find them, although some have tried to exploit them
    for their naivete. Using them as an ingredient in Fusion imbues one with a momentary
    burst of near god-like power--useful for accelerating one's skill and prowess.
  summonDesc: Ribbit! Do you want my help? Don't<br>worry, I will lend you my power,
    ribbit!
